b>אֵשׁ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Jer 17:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,27)\">Jer 17:27</ref> so of burning land of Edom <ref ref=\"Isa 34:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,10)\">Isa 34:10</ref> of annihilation of Yahweh's enemies <ref ref=\"Isa 43:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,17)\">Isa 43:17</ref> (<bdbheb>כַּפִּשְׁתָּה</bdbheb>; || <bdbheb>דָּעַךְ</bdbheb>), compare Pharaoh <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,7)\">Ezek 32:7</ref> (see above) <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְכִבּוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,7)\">2Sam 14:7</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>יְכַבֶּנָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 42:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,3)\">Isa 42:3</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תְּכַבֶּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,17)\">2Sam 21:17</ref> <bdbheb>וַיְכַבּוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,7)\">2Chr 29:7</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>כַּבּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 8:7\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,7)\">Song 8:7</ref> also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>כַּבּוֺתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,7)\">Ezek 32:7</ref> (but compare above); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְכַבֶּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:31\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick